{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：软件2Q26SaaS财报综述</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份覆盖Zeta Global与Freshworks两份软件公司财报的MS研报，核心判断并不复杂：AI功能正在从宣传走向实际收入贡献，但两家公司的增长质量存在明显差异。Zeta靠收入<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>和上调全年指引获得估值<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>，Freshworks则更多依赖成本控制带来的利润率惊喜。两者共同指向一个观察——SaaS行业的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>财报季，市场对AI变现的验证标准正在从“有没有产品”转向“能不能拉动核心指标”。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">报告发布时点值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>。Zeta的Athena平台上线仅130天，已有超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40%</span>的super-scaled客户成为月度活跃用户；Freshworks的Copilot在超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3万</span>美元的新增EX交易中附着率超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">70%</span>。这些数字说明AI产品不再停留在路线图阶段，而是进入了实际部署周期。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUHFMwOjxiaMcKJibGzJ44y1OhNKzydtm5ic4QgXts1UQr7ibiavFekTZaR9Tu8QhjQ2X63W4Xbuh99Obj4NpftkhStGYicnxqvXSfZE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1.Zeta业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">Zeta二季度收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">44%</span>，剔除并购影响后增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28%</span>，较一季度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29%</span>的增速基本持平。收入较市场预期高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.2%</span>，EBITDA高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.3%</span>，利润率同比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>170个基点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20.7%</span>。管理层将全年收入指引中值上调3300万美元，这一幅度大于二季度约2300万美元的超预期部分，同时保留了公司惯常的2-5%下半年指引保守度。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">指引上调幅度大于单季<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>，是这份财报最值得关注的信号。它意味着管理层对下半年增长的可见度在提升，而非仅仅消化已实现的业绩。报告将这一势头归因于Athena采用<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>、交叉销售与追加销售活动增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43%</span>、管道同比增长超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">60%</span>。super-scaled客户的ARPU同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17%</span>，其中多用例客户数量同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">90%</span>，使用5个以上渠道的客户增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>：</strong> 指引上调幅度大于单季<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>，通常说明公司对下半年管道转化有较高信心。但报告也提示，Athena、ZBI以及与OpenAI、Palantir合作带来的增量收入贡献仍处于早期，agency主导的社交渠道组合可能对毛利率形成抵消。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX35WX6cx1hCPAweVnq6IPmJ4uKYhEArEqRdcBrVhZeLalGlia40hlavPsZ7jqcF5D6hYQ7U9YYVCoZ6yyTFqB5zo1IZx8GVLlg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2.Freshworks业务与近期数据观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">Freshworks二季度收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>（固定汇率），达<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.374亿美元</span>，较市场预期高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.6%</span>，低于近期趋势。真正的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>来自利润端：非GAAP营业利润率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">23.6%</span>，较市场预期高出约560个基点；每股收益0.17美元，<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">高于预期</span>的0.13美元；GAAP口径下提前实现盈利。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">EX业务ARR同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">24%</span>，达<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.67亿美元</span>，约占总ARR的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">59%</span>。虽然增速较<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>略有节奏变化，管理层维持了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>中段的全年展望。超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10万</span>美元ARR的客户数量同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>，ESM ARR突破5000万美元且同比增长67%，约三分之一的新增大型EX交易包含ITAM模块。AI货币化方面，超过7000家客户为AI SKU付费。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">但净收入留存率维持在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">105%</span>，报告明确指出这些<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>向量尚未推动更广泛的留存率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">拐点</span>。CX业务仍是增长影响，ARR仅同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVicGDB1JFm6ojkFj37xm7gVro8DT7F9X9lNYq4UGlOPgVPBun1iaiceib8lWkw9NVT9bHcysaa3ib3kc2icoYdviaXia1fGTbo0FibibhjY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV8qYkCjuoW1NpA1uvSqCP9Q0E4yIaIbYyOJHCtJeibm5VlH7ZxJibc6Vic9dRlo4cFXt4223CbbYpDq3pkBTwcvLnPBwDIjbFRxs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 89-MS-Software-2Q26 SaaS Earnings Roundup-Zeta - Freshworks-260805</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
